{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春王正月，庚子，許男錫我卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"二、丁未，蔡侯申卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"三、夏，葬許昭公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"四、葬蔡文公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"五、六月癸卯，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"六、己未，公會晉侯、衞侯、曹伯、邾婁子同盟于斷道。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"七、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_131_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_131","textTraditional":"八、冬十有一月壬午，公弟叔肸卒。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}